\"Today I spoke with ... Altman to express Australia's extreme concern about this incident,\" Albanese told reporters. \"I also expressed my disappointment that it took the company way too long to inform the government what had occurred and the nature of the way that notification occurred as well was unacceptable.\""}, {"diagnostic_version": "strategic-actor-admission-diagnostics-v1", "event_id": "EVENT-F26FB7427E1B51498FC521A7", "source_id": "SOURCE-62E4F84D0677B1E6F242A961", "admission_status": "considered", "admission_reasons": [], "resolved_primary_actor": "Juspay", "entity_mentions_state": "present", "raw_actor_fields": {"primary_actor": null, "acting_entity": null, "actor": null, "organization": null, "organisation": null, "company": null, "institution": null, "regulator": null}, "raw_entity_mentions": [{"mention": "Juspay", "entity_type": "organization", "role": "actor", "raw_keys": ["context", "entity_type", "mention", "role", "sentence_id", "source_span", "type_source"]}], "event_keys": ["claim_status", "created_at", "entity_mentions", "event_dates_version", "event_end_at", "event_id", "event_start_at", "event_time_text", "event_type", "extraction_metadata", "published_at", "quantitative_claims", "relationship_mentions", "snippets", "source_id", "strategic_admission_reasons", "strategic_admission_status", "strategic_cluster_check", "strategic_cluster_development", "strategic_cluster_id", "strategic_cluster_label", "strategic_cluster_status", "strategic_cluster_terms", "strategic_dependency_tags", "strategic_event_class", "strategic_geography", "strategic_materiality_score", "strategic_mechanism_tags", "strategic_relation_signature", "strategic_theme", "strategic_time_window", "strategic_topic_linkage_type", "strategic_topic_relevance_score", "summary", "temporal_precision", "temporal_status", "title", "underlying_event_id", "underlying_event_member_count", "updated_at"], "event_summary": "Juspay FY26 revenue rises 30% to Rs 664 Cr as international business and AI bets scale Juspay FY26 revenue rises 30% to Rs 664 Cr as international business and AI bets scale Juspay reported a 30% year-on-year increase in FY26 revenue to Rs 664 crore, driven by global expansion and scaling daily transaction volumes, while strategic investments in AI infrastructure widened its net loss. Global payments technology company Juspay reported a 30% year-on-year increase in revenue for the financial year ended March 31, 2026 (FY26), reaching Rs 664 crore, up from Rs 514 crore in FY25. The Bengaluru-headquartered fintech firm remained Adjusted EBITDA positive at Rs 33 crore for FY26, excluding non-cash ESOP costs. However, increased capital allocation towards global market expansion and deep-tech artificial intelligence infrastructure widened its net loss to Rs 90 crore for the fiscal year."}, {"diagnostic_version": "strategic-actor-admission-diagnostics-v1", "event_id": "EVENT-049116C4444C8538C4F14DBE", "source_id": "SOURCE-68E783C62BEACFA9BF64436C", "admission_status": "considered", "admission_reasons": [], "resolved_primary_actor": "OpenAI", "entity_mentions_state": "present", "raw_actor_fields": {"primary_actor": null, "acting_entity": null, "actor": null, "organization": null, "organisation": null, "company": null, "institution": null, "regulator": null}, "raw_entity_mentions": [{"mention": "OpenAI", "entity_type": "organization", "role": "actor", "raw_keys": ["context", "entity_type", "mention", "role", "sentence_id", "source_span", "type_source"]}, {"mention": "OpenAI for Countries", "entity_type": "unknown", "role": "object", "raw_keys": ["context", "entity_type", "mention", "role", "sentence_id", "source_span", "type_source"]}], "event_keys": ["claim_status", "created_at", "entity_mentions", "event_dates_version", "event_end_at", "event_id", "event_start_at", "event_time_text", "event_type", "extraction_metadata", "published_at", "quantitative_claims", "relationship_mentions", "snippets", "source_id", "strategic_admission_reasons", "strategic_admission_status", "strategic_cluster_check", "strategic_cluster_development", "strategic_cluster_id", "strategic_cluster_label", "strategic_cluster_status", "strategic_cluster_terms", "strategic_dependency_tags", "strategic_event_class", "strategic_geography", "strategic_materiality_score", "strategic_mechanism_tags", "strategic_relation_signature", "strategic_theme", "strategic_time_window", "strategic_topic_linkage_type", "strategic_topic_relevance_score", "summary", "temporal_precision", "temporal_status", "title", "underlying_event_id", "underlying_event_member_count", "updated_at"], "event_summary": "Last year, OpenAI announced an initiative, OpenAI for Countries, that would fine-tune its chatbots in accordance with national laws and norms."}, {"diagnostic_version": "strategic-actor-admission-diagnostics-v1", "event_id": "EVENT-1FC4256227BF7D49479C92BD", "source_id": "SOURCE-68E783C62BEACFA9BF64436C", "admission_status": "considered", "admission_reasons": [], "resolved_primary_actor": "OpenAI", "entity_mentions_state": "present", "raw_actor_fields": {"primary_actor": null, "acting_entity": null, "actor": null, "organization": null, "organisation": null, "company": null, "institution": null, "regulator": null}, "raw_entity_mentions": [{"mention": "OpenAI", "entity_type": "organization", "role": "actor", "raw_keys": ["context", "entity_type", "mention", "role", "sentence_id", "source_span", "type_source"]}, {"mention": "United Arab Emirates", "entity_type": "unknown", "role": "object", "raw_keys": ["context", "entity_type", "mention", "role", "sentence_id", "source_span", "type_source"]}], "event_keys": ["claim_status", "created_at", "entity_mentions", "event_dates_version", "event_end_at", "event_id", "event_start_at", "event_time_text", "event_type", "extraction_metadata", "published_at", "quantitative_claims", "relationship_mentions", "snippets", "source_id", "strategic_admission_reasons", "strategic_admission_status", "strategic_cluster_check", "strategic_cluster_development", "strategic_cluster_id", "strategic_cluster_label", "strategic_cluster_status", "strategic_cluster_terms", "strategic_dependency_tags", "strategic_event_class", "strategic_geography", "strategic_materiality_score", "strategic_mechanism_tags", "strategic_relation_signature", "strategic_theme", "strategic_time_window", "strategic_topic_linkage_type", "strategic_topic_relevance_score", "summary", "temporal_precision", "temporal_status", "title", "underlying_event_id", "underlying_event_member_count", "updated_at"], "event_summary": "One of OpenAI's first country partnerships is with the United Arab Emirates, where homosexuality is illegal and criticism of the government is forbidden."}, {"diagnostic_version": "strategic-actor-admission-diagnostics-v1", "event_id": "EVENT-4AEC46E36F4A76B97A2B7E33", "source_id": "SOURCE-68E783C62BEACFA9BF64436C", "admission_status": "considered", "admission_reasons": [], "resolved_primary_actor": "Meta Oversight Board", "entity_mentions_state": "present", "raw_actor_fields": {"primary_actor": null, "acting_entity": null, "actor": null, "organization": null, "organisation": null, "company": null, "institution": null, "regulator": null}, "raw_entity_mentions": [{"mention": "Meta Oversight Board", "entity_type": "organization", "role": "actor", "raw_keys": ["context", "entity_type", "mention", "role", "sentence_id", "source_span", "type_source"]}, {"mention": "five widely used models from Anthropic, Google, and OpenAI", "entity_type": "unknown", "role": "object", "raw_keys": ["context", "entity_type", "mention", "role", "sentence_id", "source_span", "type_source"]}], "event_keys": ["claim_status", "created_at", "entity_mentions", "event_dates_version", "event_end_at", "event_id", "event_start_at", "event_time_text", "event_type", "extraction_metadata", "published_at", "quantitative_claims", "relationship_mentions", "snippets", "source_id", "strategic_admission_reasons", "strategic_admission_status", "strategic_cluster_check", "strategic_cluster_development", "strategic_cluster_id", "strategic_cluster_label", "strategic_cluster_status", "strategic_cluster_terms", "strategic_dependency_tags", "strategic_event_class", "strategic_geography", "strategic_materiality_score", "strategic_mechanism_tags", "strategic_relation_signature", "strategic_theme", "strategic_time_window", "strategic_topic_linkage_type", "strategic_topic_relevance_score", "summary", "temporal_precision", "temporal_status", "title", "underlying_event_id", "underlying_event_member_count", "updated_at"], "event_summary": "But earlier this year, the Meta Oversight Board found that five widely used models from Anthropic, Google, and OpenAI were more likely to refuse queries related to repressive governments. The board found that models were less willing to create a pamphlet criticizing the king of Thailand, which has lèse-majesté laws, than Charles III of England, which doesn't."}, {"diagnostic_version": "strategic-actor-admission-diagnostics-v1", "event_id": "EVENT-506B25A9DE398839C82B55C7", "source_id": "SOURCE-68E783C62BEACFA9BF64436C", "admission_status": "considered", "admission_reasons": [], "resolved_primary_actor": "UK AI Security Institute", "entity_mentions_state": "present", "raw_actor_fields": {"primary_actor": null, "acting_entity": null, "actor": null, "organization": null, "organisation": null, "company": null, "institution": null, "regulator": null}, "raw_entity_mentions": [{"mention": "UK AI Security Institute", "entity_type": "organization", "role": "actor", "raw_keys": ["context", "entity_type", "mention", "role", "sentence_id", "source_span", "type_source"]}, {"mention": "Anthropic models", "entity_type": "unknown", "role": "object", "raw_keys": ["context", "entity_type", "mention", "role", "sentence_id", "source_span", "type_source"]}], "event_keys": ["claim_status", "created_at", "entity_mentions", "event_dates_version", "event_end_at", "event_id", "event_start_at", "event_time_text", "event_type", "extraction_metadata", "published_at", "quantitative_claims", "relationship_mentions", "snippets", "source_id", "strategic_admission_reasons", "strategic_admission_status", "strategic_cluster_check", "strategic_cluster_development", "strategic_cluster_id", "strategic_cluster_label", "strategic_cluster_status", "strategic_cluster_terms", "strategic_dependency_tags", "strategic_event_class", "strategic_geography", "strategic_materiality_score", "strategic_mechanism_tags", "strategic_relation_signature", "strategic_theme", "strategic_time_window", "strategic_topic_linkage_type", "strategic_topic_relevance_score", "summary", "temporal_precision", "temporal_status", "title", "underlying_event_id", "underlying_event_member_count", "updated_at"], "event_summary": "Last winter, the UK AI Security Institute found that Anthropic models sometimes refused to assist in certain tasks related to AI safety research. Yet three of them refused more than half of what Anthropic called \"a set of reasonable AI safety research tasks.\""}, {"diagnostic_version": "strategic-actor-admission-diagnostics-v1", "event_id": "EVENT-5560D8F2BAA83D9051C5E323", "source_id": "SOURCE-68E783C62BEACFA9BF64436C", "admission_status": "considered", "admission_reasons": [], "resolved_primary_actor": "OpenAI", "entity_mentions_state": "present", "raw_actor_fields": {"primary_actor": null, "acting_entity": null, "actor": null, "organization": null, "organisation": null, "company": null, "institution": null, "regulator": null}, "raw_entity_mentions": [{"mention": "OpenAI", "entity_type": "organization", "role": "actor", "raw_keys": ["context", "entity_type", "mention", "role", "sentence_id", "source_span", "type_source"]}, {"mention": "rules for how models should refuse", "entity_type": "unknown", "role": "object", "raw_keys": ["context", "entity_type", "mention", "role", "sentence_id", "source_span", "type_source"]}], "event_keys": ["claim_status", "created_at", "entity_mentions", "event_date_precision", "event_dates_version", "event_end_at", "event_id", "event_start_at", "event_time_resolved", "event_time_text", "event_type", "extraction_metadata", "published_at", "quantitative_claims", "relationship_mentions", "snippets", "source_id", "strategic_admission_reasons", "strategic_admission_status", "strategic_cluster_check", "strategic_cluster_development", "strategic_cluster_id", "strategic_cluster_label", "strategic_cluster_status", "strategic_cluster_terms", "strategic_dependency_tags", "strategic_event_class", "strategic_geography", "strategic_materiality_score", "strategic_mechanism_tags", "strategic_relation_signature", "strategic_theme", "strategic_time_window", "strategic_topic_linkage_type", "strategic_topic_relevance_score", "summary", "temporal_precision", "temporal_status", "title", "underlying_event_id", "underlying_event_member_count", "updated_at"], "event_summary": "(In 2024, OpenAI established rules for how models should refuse: Always apologize, and don't be judgy.)"}, {"diagnostic_version": "strategic-actor-admission-diagnostics-v1", "event_id": "EVENT-6ED957DCBEBF48C1CED41520", "source_id": "SOURCE-68E783C62BEACFA9BF64436C", "admission_status": "considered", "admission_reasons": [], "resolved_primary_actor": "OpenAI", "entity_mentions_state": "present", "raw_actor_fields": {"primary_actor": null, "acting_entity": null, "actor": null, "organization": null, "organisation": null, "company": null, "institution": null, "regulator": null}, "raw_entity_mentions": [{"mention": "OpenAI", "entity_type": "organization", "role": "actor", "raw_keys": ["context", "entity_type", "mention", "role", "sentence_id", "source_span", "type_source"]}, {"mention": "red-teamers", "entity_type": "unknown", "role": "object", "raw_keys": ["context", "entity_type", "mention", "role", "sentence_id", "source_span", "type_source"]}], "event_keys": ["claim_status", "created_at", "entity_mentions", "event_date_precision", "event_dates_version", "event_end_at", "event_id", "event_start_at", "event_time_resolved", "event_time_text", "event_type", "extraction_metadata", "published_at", "quantitative_claims", "relationship_mentions", "snippets", "source_id", "strategic_admission_reasons", "strategic_admission_status", "strategic_cluster_check", "strategic_cluster_development", "strategic_cluster_id", "strategic_cluster_label", "strategic_cluster_status", "strategic_cluster_terms", "strategic_dependency_tags", "strategic_event_class", "strategic_geography", "strategic_materiality_score", "strategic_mechanism_tags", "strategic_relation_signature", "strategic_theme", "strategic_time_window", "strategic_topic_linkage_type", "strategic_topic_relevance_score", "summary", "temporal_precision", "temporal_status", "title", "underlying_event_id", "underlying_event_member_count", "updated_at"], "event_summary": "Back in 2022, when AI was still far from mastering refusal, OpenAI enlisted dozens of \"red-teamers\" to probe the capabilities of its latest model. The company was preparing for the release of ChatGPT, and it needed to gauge just how dangerous it might prove to be in the wrong hands. The red-teamers were given minimal directions, Röttger told me. Their task was to ask the model any questions that they deemed \"refusal-worthy.\" Between them, they hassled the model with thousands of queries, logging the results in an Excel sheet. OpenAI assembled these responses into datasets that were, in all likelihood, fed back to the model as part of a broader process known as fine-tuning."}, {"diagnostic_version": "strategic-actor-admission-diagnostics-v1", "event_id": "EVENT-719BA2AC4874AF820278FDF9", "source_id": "SOURCE-68E783C62BEACFA9BF64436C", "admission_status": "considered", "admission_reasons": [], "resolved_primary_actor": "Anthropic", "entity_mentions_state": "present", "raw_actor_fields": {"primary_actor": null, "acting_entity": null, "actor": null, "organization": null, "organisation": null, "company": null, "institution": null, "regulator": null}, "raw_entity_mentions": [{"mention": "Anthropic", "entity_type": "organization", "role": "actor", "raw_keys": ["context", "entity_type", "mention", "role", "sentence_id", "source_span", "type_source"]}, {"mention": "chatbots' compute costs", "entity_type": "unknown", "role": "object", "raw_keys": ["context", "entity_type", "mention", "role", "sentence_id", "source_span", "type_source"]}], "event_keys": ["claim_status", "created_at", "entity_mentions", "event_dates_version", "event_end_at", "event_id", "event_start_at", "event_time_text", "event_type", "extraction_metadata", "published_at", "quantitative_claims", "relationship_mentions", "snippets", "source_id", "strategic_admission_reasons", "strategic_admission_status", "strategic_cluster_check", "strategic_cluster_development", "strategic_cluster_id", "strategic_cluster_label", "strategic_cluster_status", "strategic_cluster_terms", "strategic_dependency_tags", "strategic_event_class", "strategic_geography", "strategic_materiality_score", "strategic_mechanism_tags", "strategic_relation_signature", "strategic_theme", "strategic_time_window", "strategic_topic_linkage_type", "strategic_topic_relevance_score", "summary", "temporal_precision", "temporal_status", "title", "underlying_event_id", "underlying_event_member_count", "updated_at"], "event_summary": "Earlier this year, Anthropic said that one type of classifier added 24% to its chatbots' compute costs."}, {"diagnostic_version": "strategic-actor-admission-diagnostics-v1", "event_id": "EVENT-90343D33355D1DD728623AC9", "source_id": "SOURCE-68E783C62BEACFA9BF64436C", "admission_status": "considered", "admission_reasons": [], "resolved_primary_actor": "Anthropic", "entity_mentions_state": "present", "raw_actor_fields": {"primary_actor": null, "acting_entity": null, "actor": null, "organization": null, "organisation": null, "company": null, "institution": null, "regulator": null}, "raw_entity_mentions": [{"mention": "Anthropic", "entity_type": "organization", "role": "actor", "raw_keys": ["context", "entity_type", "mention", "role", "sentence_id", "source_span", "type_source"]}, {"mention": "safety margins", "entity_type": "unknown", "role": "object", "raw_keys": ["context", "entity_type", "mention", "role", "sentence_id", "source_span", "type_source"]}], "event_keys": ["claim_status", "created_at", "entity_mentions", "event_date_precision", "event_dates_version", "event_end_at", "event_id", "event_start_at", "event_time_resolved", "event_time_text", "event_type", "extraction_metadata", "published_at", "quantitative_claims", "relationship_mentions", "snippets", "source_id", "strategic_admission_reasons", "strategic_admission_status", "strategic_cluster_check", "strategic_cluster_development", "strategic_cluster_id", "strategic_cluster_label", "strategic_cluster_status", "strategic_cluster_terms", "strategic_dependency_tags", "strategic_event_class", "strategic_geography", "strategic_materiality_score", "strategic_mechanism_tags", "strategic_relation_signature", "strategic_theme", "strategic_time_window", "strategic_topic_linkage_type", "strategic_topic_relevance_score", "summary", "temporal_precision", "temporal_status", "title", "underlying_event_id", "underlying_event_member_count", "updated_at"], "event_summary": "In August, Anthropic loosened its safety margins again, and admitted that building classifiers \"is not a straightforward task.\""}, {"diagnostic_version": "strategic-actor-admission-diagnostics-v1", "event_id": "EVENT-C5CD343A023EF8B50D9702E4", "source_id": "SOURCE-68E783C62BEACFA9BF64436C", "admission_status": "considered", "admission_reasons": [], "resolved_primary_actor": "Anthropic", "entity_mentions_state": "present", "raw_actor_fields": {"primary_actor": null, "acting_entity": null, "actor": null, "organization": null, "organisation": null, "company": null, "institution": null, "regulator": null}, "raw_entity_mentions": [{"mention": "Anthropic", "entity_type": "organization", "role": "actor", "raw_keys": ["